  "instructions": [
    "heat the butter in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook until softened.",
    "add the ground beef and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon.",
    "add the chilli peppers, canned tomato, flour, and a pinch of salt and pepper. stir to combine.",
    "bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "stir in the milk and grated cheddar cheese until melted and smooth.",
    "add the mashed potatoes to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "stir in the candy (such as caramel sauce).",
    "transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with additional grated cheese.",
    "bake at 375 degrees Fahrenheit for 25 minutes, or until golden brown and bubbly.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs (such as parsley or chives)."
  ],
